        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "合　壹萬百九十二石九升九合七勺壹才四扎　但シ一石八圓位"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "合　一万百九十二石九升九合七勺一才四扎　但し一石八円位"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Combined tax total: 10,192.099714 koku (the 斗 place is skipped, i.e. zero), with the note 'reckoning one koku at about eight yen.' The figure reconciles to the last printed digit: the two cash sums are 80.1875 and 13,574.875 ryō and the two copper sums 100 and 1,486 mon; taking the 1,586 mon as 0.1586 ryō gives 13,655.2211 ryō, which at eight to the koku is 1,706.9026375 koku, and adding the 8,485.197077 koku of rice gives 10,192.0997145 — the printed 10,192.099714 with the last place cut."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "租税合計"
